            "question": "What's in the bundle?",
            "answer": "<p>The Pillow Top Organic Latex Mattress by Gary Brecka, the SnoozeLift 5.0 Adjustable Base, two Kloud organic pillows, a Breezeline organic cotton sheet set, and an organic mattress protector, all matched to your selected size. A complete sleep system.</p>"
