          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the sheets and protector made of?",
            "answer": "<p>The sheets are Breezeline organic cotton with a cooling weave, in a set of one fitted sheet, one flat sheet, and two pillowcases. The protector pairs an ORGANIC-AIR organic cotton comfort layer with a MoistureGuard plant-based, breathable, water-resistant barrier, with corner straps for a secure fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_j3cjpx": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I choose the pillow and sheet type?",
            "answer": "<p>Bundle accessories are fixed as configured. If you want to swap items, you can build a custom bundle on the mattress page, or call a Sleep Expert at <a href=\"tel:7197516070\" title=\"tel:7197516070\">(719) 751-6070</a> to arrange one.</p>"
          }
        },
